                    portion of <ref target="#d403">Document 403</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d407-f3" n="3" xml:id="d407-f3-content">
                <p>This figure was recommended in the Financial Appendix to PSB D–23, not printed. The National Security Council did not
                    approve the Appendix, however, but deferred decision on the question of seeking
                    additional funds; see <ref target="#d400">Document 400</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
